<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAFRICA'S SANMED WINS AA FINANCIAL SECURITY RATING.</title>
<headline>SAFRICA'S SANMED WINS AA FINANCIAL SECURITY RATING.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African insurance giant Sanlam's Sanmed medical aid scheme has been rated AA for financial security by the independent credit rating agency, Republic Ratings.</p>
<p>Sanmed senior operations manager Roly Buys said in a statement on Monday that a conservative reserves policy had enabled it to establish a strong credit rating without jeopardising its competitiveness in the market.</p>
<p>Sanmed covers all Sanlam staff as well as the staff of several large corporations.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
